# Normalise line endings in the index. Added 2026-08-24 after a Python
# read-modify-write on two CRLF files rewrote them as LF, turning a 12-line
# change into a 756-insertion/744-deletion diff that nobody could review.
# The tool was the trigger; the absence of this file was the cause.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries and lockfiles keep their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
